{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:30 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"Mandy譚旻萱同樣「無縫換畫」搭上黃澤林？前度區顯揚暗示「戴綠帽」  3月曾滑雪洩蜜\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49537ca3b8d1ad26919cf2af975ad1d2/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_167.png\"/>\n<p>「籃球女神」譚旻萱（Mandy）日前被爆與「香港網球一哥」黃澤林熱戀，卻因男方與陳奕迅女兒陳康堤分手不久即有新歡，而被質疑「無縫接軌」質疑。豈料一波未平一波又起，網民極速起底譚旻萱的戀情時間線，質疑她同樣是「無縫換畫」。在兩人戀情曝光後，譚旻萱的餐廳老闆兼排球教練前男友區顯揚（Austin）突然在IG連發三個限時動態，其中一個更貼出「綠色手掌」照片，引來網民揣測，質疑他暗示自己「戴綠帽」。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱與區顯揚3月曾滑雪洩蜜</h2>\n<p>回顧這段逝去的戀情，譚旻萱於2023年曾大方認愛導演Christopher，但原來男方早成過去式。譚旻萱的下一任男友其實是現年37歲的區顯揚。兩人雖然愛得低調，但今年三月曾穿上情侶裝到外地滑雪，區顯揚更在IG曬出兩人坐吊車的甜蜜背影照，相中女伴身穿的灰白色豹紋滑雪裝，正正與譚旻萱當時發布的單人照戲服一模一樣。如今新歡登場，譚旻萱與區顯揚已在IG互相取消關注，似乎是正式宣告分手做不成朋友。</p>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林日前出戰比賽，有網民發現他身邊已有新女伴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b22b856efb385a2751bacf880f72300/2026-10/a3_33.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"正是有「籃球女神」之稱譚旻萱（Mandy）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0cec59ab1f2ce4700862b7fd2e048d5/2026-10/A7_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Mandy伸手攬黃澤林。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6f51bb17fa54633cc4c416199055ce7/2026-10/a8_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林與Mandy表現親暱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a077f765ea7c2d2be40a2fcc646a390a/2026-10/a12_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱（Mandy）近年成為圈中新星，工作不斷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a8a5d6e8e3b68076c387b84a316437f/2026-10/A14.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"今年9月10日譚旻萱於IG發帖，當時黃澤林已火速撳Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6b55f93cf5080226b808c9e49110acb/2026-10/1_10_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱這輯相迷倒黃澤林。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/596a5d2794c547e21c43056034bee704/2026-10/3_3_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在兩人戀情曝光後，譚旻萱的餐廳老闆兼排球教練前男友區顯揚（Austin）突然在IG連發三個限時動態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/050b2b283b5eef7a01a9d256dba6a0b4/2026-10/austinauhinyeung_1693583389_3182330584395400483_207965317.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱與區顯揚3月時曾滑雪洩蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65477ece93ec060e26e968b4ad660862/2026-10/1_10_40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱與區顯揚之前低調拍拖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ddc160512ed6cdbad0b56783ca0fb7f/2026-10/2_10_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱與區顯揚曾經於IG放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/177a1f0032c2322089d8f02918135bd6/2026-10/3_3_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"面對前女友譚旻萱極速搭上黃澤林，區顯揚在IG連發黑白限時動態，無奈寫道：「識我嘅就唔好問我，唔好再send比我，我唔係幾想睇到，人哋嘅事我唔清楚。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bb696ac4be8a98049fbe03633afa1f2/2026-10/4_10_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"隨後區顯揚貼出「綠色手掌」照，引來網民聯想。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0ec5a6bf5bddd559945e5bbb4092db6/2026-10/5_9_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"區顯揚求助如何清洗綠色顏料的。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cfdd20d526941c7a63de35948fc2c8fa/2026-10/6_11_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"區顯揚是餐廳老闆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c7c8dadb9332ea2e7ff065e3117705e/2026-10/austinauhinyeung_1705159006_3279433895099530899_207965317.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"區顯揚原來與譚旻萱地下情多時，近日似乎被飛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5bb0cf0a02d9425ea11210eba2e2bb0/2026-10/austinauhinyeung_1617179310_2541406713241609617_207965317.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"區顯揚亦是一名排球教練。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95c3f2763fd621080d3379c6a2702b51/2026-10/austinauhinyeung_1676525286_3039236843686886443_207965317.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"區顯揚曾參與ViuTV戀愛真人騷《35+ LOVE》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3fd7dc8bb3e4df727fbec19023a3f80/2026-10/austinauhinyeung_1700313617_3238787827940993783_207965317.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"區顯揚與Aka趙慧珊擦出火花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bc3c3818fb4609fd37d8d914091758a/2026-10/austinauhinyeung_1700313617_3238787827941032140_207965317.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在賀歲片《夜王》演夜總會女公關「ChiLing」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c19e8da4c679b9675962716ccaab7d7/2026-02/MandyTam_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱少女時代。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c4c35d99ea02f0a9e737603eb2a5d56/2026-02/MandyTam_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱生得高大，但越大越靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63fb11bc80a944c4c629fc5aa3ece9ee/2026-02/MandyTam_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱樣子甜美，身材不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46c5c4f9acb2eeb912d43f293866fb5e/2023-12/mandy_30__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱是運動健將。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/711c6e2b9ac7297fe55a34ccb3a7785b/2023-12/mandy_19__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱曾屬籃球隊活躍成員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c51665b89e42dc6c0b5c1898ee8c688b/2023-12/mandy_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱2023年8月拍廣告，身後的男子就是Christopher。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cae4a1cb74d9b3700d89aedd99a578d1/2023-12/mandy_3__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤今年4月與香港網球一哥黃澤林（Coleman）相戀，豈料認愛半年已分手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39709696027b98a37f58fd3a1009d66f/2026-06/3_28.jpg\"/>\n<h2>區顯揚開腔回應綠帽疑雲</h2>\n<p>面對前女友譚旻萱極速搭上黃澤林，區顯揚在IG連發黑白限時動態，無奈寫道：「識我嘅就唔好問我，唔好再send比我，我唔係幾想睇到，人哋嘅事我唔清楚。」隨後他貼出沾滿綠色顏料的手掌照片求助如何清洗，雖然後來澄清只是洗得掉的水溶性色素，並搞笑澄清「冇幫Hulk打飛X」，但「綠色手掌」的敏感隱喻仍引來網民聯想。這位曾參與ViuTV戀愛真人騷《35+ LOVE》並與Aka趙慧珊擦出火花的排球男神，感情路上似乎又再碰壁。</p>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林為港隊取得亞運首面網球金牌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc077d0510f2c2d0cfeae9260f048a09/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_11_37_50_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林在10月中於網絡頻道直播親口證實與陳奕迅女兒陳康堤已經分手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a8b2e3df9db0d825d7282990671c86d/2026-10/3333_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤在9月底已於IG取消關注黃澤林。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac6976590a7a6a907ca4d5327a681c24/2026-09/1_8_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林同樣已Unfollow陳康堤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5499283d7c878af6ed14c4e30ffe76a7/2026-09/2_3_72.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤大方承認與黃澤林已分手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/05a8147cef25aa45a04a42342c13b819/2026-10/002_1_18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"再問分手原因，陳康堤說：「我們大家有共識，（因為甚麼事而分手？）私人事，兩個人之間的事。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3eda88a1c635496f4c362d36c0ad123a/2026-10/011_0_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"再問是否有第三者，陳康堤只說：「這些不回應了，大家不要胡亂猜測太多。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e075c026b77fca044e9298eabd6fe529/2026-10/012_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤坦承與黃澤林分手後無聯絡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7de819443aa418e04f67e7720a3743c4/2026-10/014_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤與黃澤林拍拖期間，曾與陳奕迅飛到法國力撐男友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93c651d2a0a62b543d4c6f5d36c58c6e/2026-05/c_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤全力為對方打氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/648e0a01bef6499f7f634a9c295e1d8d/2026-05/d_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林贏波後，陳奕迅當時被指緊擁「未來女婿」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/489e593e15f45218c29f8036cd03fabe/2026-05/f_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅與老婆徐濠縈去年為女兒陳康堤慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c438eac16bd531bbbd625cb2ff28c65e/2025-10/Constance_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤自與黃澤林傳情變後，生活如常。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/913dac5bafa668c9cc95c6930d5ae183/2026-10/constance_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤10月初慶祝22歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a284212d21bfb77ab469a7f18d1580d0/2026-10/CONSTANCE_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤10月4日在IG貼出童年相，並留言：「Happy 22 BAO BAO 健康快樂做自己」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb68b33d3ea24d40d3ad88d62887afdd/2026-10/constance_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤22歲生日去了巴黎出席時尚品牌活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6cd806ea1e03fc9e670214b4e24ea03/2026-10/CONSTANCE_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤穿上品牌服飾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b74fc35c23a31b74587985cc3e0522e1/2026-10/CONSTANCE_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤出席時裝騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82fee15bf677b73f95c7c79146fb9116/2026-10/CONSTANCE_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤最近被爆與黃澤林分手，心情未見受影響。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a8093b0f983b1cee3ab69a882121bc1/2026-10/CONSTANCE_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c8221dd32e0d39f1187c8013a45d38f/2026-10/CONSTANCE_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤在IG分享生活日常。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58f31875fe3e715ba65ed3a533c696a7/2026-10/CONSTANCE_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤在IG晒出多張友人照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26d940b64f8ff66bcc5f8c4790f49849/2026-10/CONSTANCE_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤到巴黎鐵塔下打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6201f583fb4d178ba4104f8a635a3e5d/2026-10/CONSTANCE_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤此行飲飲食食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f89ab4ff71248d5c77718a76e9769d4/2026-10/CONSTANCE_10__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤活潑好動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9754ebec440435e875e07624827d2bad/2026-10/CONSTANCE_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤完全看不出情傷的痕跡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6e6607124a571cba4e278e00a0e37b6/2026-10/CONSTANCE_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤笑得燦爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21138f223374added687918d4bc8d0ee/2026-10/CONSTANCE_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤有感而發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e81bf61771b4e3066d5d1d9c1f1cc58/2026-10/6493_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤爸爸陳奕迅跟黃澤林認識。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/02a4d6417a7cdec78c2957895b2c5ea0/2026-04/ENP01P18210226.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林職業生涯與戀情樣受外界關注。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72d31c480f9f772451f0b224b1d7dc96/2026-06/coleman_wong_1780741041_3913461147845788191_3318146344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網球一哥黃澤林發文用陳奕迅歌曲，當時被指行「外父政策」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34abf0f732db7e6ecb9b46d37ee6666d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_9_29_22_PM.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:13.162716+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":652,"images":59,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:58:45.268397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:38.499369+00:00","content_hash":"6bc0b0e4e9b6055f32ae896258317f4fd797709fcc3959acdb6cac516429104f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}